    - VERDICT: CONFIRMED — OPTIMISTIC_ROLLBACK_FAILURE
    Reason: declineRequest removes the connection from state (line 225-226),
    but on failure the error is thrown WITHOUT restoring the connection.
    The UI will show the request as declined even though the server rejected.

  Mark notification read (notification-store.ts markAsRead):
    - OPTIMISTIC: decrements unread + marks local
    - On failure: ROLLBACK via get().refresh() — restores server truth
    - VERDICT: PASS — optimistic with refresh-based rollback

  Mark all read (notification-store.ts markAllAsRead):
    - OPTIMISTIC: sets all read + zeros badge
    - On failure: ROLLBACK via get().refresh()
    - VERDICT: PASS — optimistic with refresh-based rollback

